| MaleSteadyChanceCondomUsePerEventLowMean    | targeted
| MaleSteadyChanceCondomUsePerEventLowStdDev  | targeted
| MaleSteadyPartnershipDurationHighMean       | targeted
| MaleSteadyPartnershipDurationHighStdDev     | targeted
| MaleSteadyPartnershipDurationHighShift      | targeted
| MaleSteadyPartnershipDurationLowMean        | targeted
