| MaleCasualChanceCondomUsePerEventHighMean   | targeted
| MaleCasualChanceCondomUsePerEventHighStdDev | targeted
| MaleCasualChanceCondomUsePerEventLowMean    | targeted
| MaleCasualChanceCondomUsePerEventLowStdDev  | targeted
| MaleCasualPartnershipDurationHighMean       | targeted
